        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "One observation per completed page-channel Subscribe replay. Since #323 a replay is a single `page-replay` frame carrying every stroke batch, every tombstone batch and `last_seq`, so frames should read 1 — anything higher is a regression. `mean` is exact (sum / count); p50 / p95 are interpolated within buckets — read `mean` over a window holding one replay for a baseline."
